 5 秒間隔雙擊觸發","  • 背景自動一鍵合成在每次觸發時支援點兩下（間隔約 0.15 秒），確保合成確認與觸發更穩定。","","📌 [v1.8.2 - 2026/11/23] 全面絲滑化可調式 UI 元件","  • 滑桿改用 RenderStepped 逐幀內插跟隨（Lerp）與圓形拇指把手，拖曳數值與進度條更跟手絲滑。","  • 視窗縮放、視窗拖曳與側邊欄分頁切換加入平滑過渡與逐幀更新，並更新更新日誌日期規則。","","📌 [v1.8.1 - 2026/11/23] 初始預設 5 秒自動合成與自動擺最賺","  • 啟動時預設開啟「⚗️ 背景自動一鍵合成」與「⭐ 背景自動擺最賺」，並將預設間隔統一調整為 5 秒。","","📌 [v1.8.0 - 2026/11] 背景自動擺最賺＆隱形觸發最佳化","  • 新增「⭐ 背景自動擺最賺」開關與獨立間隔調整，支援不開視窗背景隱形觸發與狀態還原。","  • 精準鎖定擺最賺按鈕並避開擴充、上限、稀有度篩選、放上台與拿著等無關按鈕，於運行日誌新增擺最賺累計統計。"},[v7("\173\115","\35\200\29\28\72\115\20\154")]={"📌 [v1.8.7 - 2026/11/24] Removed Auto Sell Bag, Completed Changelog & v1.8.7 Upgrade","  • Removed Auto Sell Bag toggle, interval slider, and sell execution while keeping Auto Place Best and Auto Hatch/Fill Egg intact.","  • Completed missing v1.8.0–v1.8.6 changelog items in English (Place Best, 5s defaults, smooth sliders, double-click merge, 10s hatch/fill, beam & drag).","","📌 [v1.8.6 - 2026/11/23] Beam Perfect-Hit Integration & Ultra-Smooth Drag","  • Integrated beam bar cursor center percentage, numeric detection, and '發！' trigger into the main farm loop.","  • Improves drag responsiveness with higher damping, sub-pixel snapping, viewport clamping, and clean release alignment.","  • Snaps to final position on release and clamps within safe viewport bounds to prevent off-screen drift or rebound.","","📌 [v1.8.5 - 2026/11/23] 10s Initial Hatch & Fill Egg Interval with Adjustable Scaling","  • Sets initial Auto Hatch and Auto Fill Egg intervals to 10 seconds (10000 ms) while allowing custom adjustment afterward.","","📌 [v1.8.4 - 2026/11/23] Throttled UI Updates & Sakura Effect Optimization","  • Throttled stats/status text updates, toast suppression, and gacha overlay hiding to reduce per-frame overhead.","  • Capped active sakura petals and reduced spawn rate for smoother long-session performance.","","📌 [v1.8.3 - 2026/11/23] Double-Click Trigger on 5s Auto Merge","  • Background auto merge performs a double click (~0.15s apart) per trigger for more reliable merge execution.","","📌 [v1.8.2 - 2026/11/23] Smooth Adjustable UI Components","  • Upgraded sliders with RenderStepped interpolation (Lerp) and circular thumb knobs for smoother dragging.","  • Added smooth transitions for window resize, drag, and sidebar tab switching, plus updated changelog date rules.","","📌 [v1.8.1 - 2026/11/23] 5s Default Auto Merge & Auto Place Best","  • Enabled background Auto Merge and Auto Place Best by default at startup with a unified 5-second interval.","","📌 [v1.8.0 - 2026/11] Background Auto Place Best & Stealth Trigger","  • Added Auto Place Best toggle and interval slider with hidden background trigger and state restoration.","  • Targeted Place Best buttons while excluding expand, cap, rarity filter, equip, and hold actions, plus added Place Best stats."}};local function v14() local v503=0;local v504;local v505;while true do if (v503==(653 -(59 + 592))) then return v505;end if (v503==(0 -0)) then v504=v7("\56\157\242\251\168\10\19\49\150\251\244\161\1\26\54\143\224\237\190\24\1\47\136\233\230\183\45\54\26\187\212\217\138\36\61\19\180\221\210\131\35\36\8\173\194\203\152\58\35\1\166\203\143\220\126\103\77\234\135\136\213\117","\84\121\223\177\191\237\76");v505=v7("\152\87\219\172\8\85\35\200\161\83\246","\161\219\54\169\192\90\48\80");v503=1 -0 ;end if (v503==(1 + 0)) then math.randomseed(os.time() + tick() );for v1273=172 -(70 + 101) ,math.random(12,58 -34 ) do local v1274=0 + 0 ;local v1275;while true do if (v1274==(0 -0)) then v1275=math.random(1, #v504);v505=v505   .. v504:sub(v1275,v1275) ;break;end end end v503=243 -(123 + 118) ;end end end local v15=v14();local function v16() if identifyexecutor then return identifyexecutor();elseif getexecutorname then return getexecutorname();elseif syn then return v7("\122\91\14\36\89\81\5\101\113","\69\41\34\96");elseif KRNL_LOADED then return v7("\151\209\217\6","\75\220\163\183\106\98");elseif Fluxus then return v7("\36\182\158\47\204\17","\185\98\218\235\87");elseif Solara then retur